MAIN
MOVE TEMP 30 4
MOVE TEMP 31 HALLOCATE TEMP 30
MOVE TEMP 24 TEMP 31
MOVE TEMP 32 4
MOVE TEMP 33 HALLOCATE TEMP 32
MOVE TEMP 25 TEMP 33
MOVE TEMP 34 Fac_ComputeFac
HSTORE TEMP 24 0 TEMP 34
MOVE TEMP 35 TEMP 24
HSTORE TEMP 25 0 TEMP 35
MOVE TEMP 23 TEMP 25
HLOAD TEMP 21 TEMP 23 0
HLOAD TEMP 22 TEMP 21 0
MOVE TEMP 36 10
MOVE TEMP 37 CALL TEMP 22 ( TEMP 23 TEMP 36 )
PRINT TEMP 37
END
Fac_ComputeFac [ 2 ]
BEGIN
MOVE TEMP 38 0
MOVE TEMP 39 LE TEMP 1 TEMP 38
CJUMP TEMP 39 L2
MOVE TEMP 40 1
MOVE TEMP 20 TEMP 40
JUMP L3
L2 MOVE TEMP 29 TEMP 0
HLOAD TEMP 27 TEMP 29 0
HLOAD TEMP 28 TEMP 27 0
MOVE TEMP 41 1
MOVE TEMP 42 MINUS TEMP 1 TEMP 41
MOVE TEMP 43 CALL TEMP 28 ( TEMP 29 TEMP 42 )
MOVE TEMP 44 TIMES TEMP 1 TEMP 43
MOVE TEMP 20 TEMP 44
L3  NOOP

RETURN TEMP 20
END

